Package: mainsub
Type: Package
Title: Quiet Academic Report Formats for R Markdown
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mainsub", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "196950969+Mainsub-Linvega@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: R Markdown output formats (PDF via XeLaTeX, small self-contained
    HTML) and a matching 'ggplot2' theme that share one typographic design with
    the LaTeX, Typst and Quarto templates in the same repository: LaTeX
    lecture-notes look, Chinese/English support, three-line tables, shared maths
    macros.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    rmarkdown (>= 2.14),
    bookdown (>= 0.30),
    knitr (>= 1.40)
Suggests:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4),
    ragg
URL: https://github.com/Mainsub-Linvega/mainsub-templates
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
